{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":1957849,"name":"revernator","username":"revernator-325772","avatar_template":"/en/wow/plugins/discourse-blizzard-plugin/images/avatars/wow/default.png","created_at":"2020-06-20T15:07:49.743Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003ewtf is going on with pet battles against NPCs. for eg:\" liz the tormentor in stratholm pet battle, as soon as you get her to 1k hp, she instantly heals yet she has used no attack/spell to self heal, then on nxt attack she 1 shots all 3 of your pets,\" how can anyone progress when it is clear that there is major issues when doing pet battles against npcs, this npc is not alone, alot of the npcs that players have to battle against do similar things, deadmines being another the first npc you fight 1 shots your entire team on first attack.\u003cbr\u003e\ngood going blizzard, another wicked idea completly ruined, i would appreciate any help as to weather its a bug or im doing something wrong, as i am a player with physical disabilities\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":7,"updated_at":"2020-06-23T11:54:09.182Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":184,"reads":22,"readers_count":21,"score":924.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":159884,"topic_slug":"bugged-pet-battles-against-quest-npcs","display_username":"revernator","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":325772,"hidden":false,"trust_level":1,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"user_custom_fields":{"profile_url":"https://worldofwarcraft.com/en-gb/character/eu/shattered-halls/revclown/","race":"Gnome","class":"Warlock","player_class_enum":"WARLOCK","blizzard_post_count":"7","guild":"Guardians of the Light","achievement_points":"13495","level":"120","classic":"t"},"post_url":"/t/bugged-pet-battles-against-quest-npcs/159884/1","alias_avatar":"https://render-eu.worldofwarcraft.com/character/shattered-halls/117/70797685-avatar.jpg?alt=/wow/static/images/2d/avatar/7-0.jpg","alias_username":"Revclown","poster_alias":{"alias":{"name":"Revclown","avatar":"https://render-eu.worldofwarcraft.com/character/shattered-halls/117/70797685-avatar.jpg?alt=/wow/static/images/2d/avatar/7-0.jpg","url":"https://worldofwarcraft.com/en-gb/character/eu/shattered-halls/revclown/","user_id":325772,"id":783954,"selected":false,"post_count":7,"alias_custom_fields":[{"name":"profile_url","value":"https://worldofwarcraft.com/en-gb/character/eu/shattered-halls/revclown/"},{"name":"realm","value":"Shattered Halls"},{"name":"achievement_points","value":"13495"},{"name":"level","value":"120"},{"name":"race","value":"Gnome"},{"name":"player_class","value":"Warlock"},{"name":"player_class_enum","value":"WARLOCK"},{"name":"guild","value":"Guardians of the Light"}]}},"reply_to_alias":null,"animated_avatar":null,"user_post_count":7,"character":{"name":"revernator","guild":"Guardians of the Light","achievement_points":"13495","level":"120","class":"Warlock","race":"Gnome","player_class_enum":"WARLOCK","classic":true},"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":1957948,"name":"CoffeeTime","username":"CoffeeTime-234570","avatar_template":"/en/wow/plugins/discourse-blizzard-plugin/images/avatars/wow/default.png","created_at":"2020-06-20T16:03:29.845Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eI will say to you what I say in every case where somebody claims there is a problem with a pet battle or a strategy.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCheck your facts before wasting people’s time\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBring logs\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLook at Liz’s abilities. Read the tooltips. Understand them.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003caside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://www.wowhead.com/npc=150925/liz-the-tormentor\"\u003e\n  \u003cheader class=\"source\"\u003e\n      \u003cimg src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/logos/favicon-live.png\" class=\"site-icon\" alt=\"\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"\u003e\n\n      \u003ca href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/npc=150925/liz-the-tormentor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003eWowhead\u003c/a\u003e\n  \u003c/header\u003e\n\n  \u003carticle class=\"onebox-body\"\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"aspect-image\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:387/500;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1230559-liz-the-tormentor.jpg\" class=\"thumbnail\" alt=\"\" width=\"387\" height=\"500\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/npc=150925/liz-the-tormentor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003eLiz the Tormentor\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\n  \u003cp\u003eThis battle pet cannot be tamed. Magic battle pet. The location of this NPC is unknown. In the Magic Battle Pets category. Added in World of Warcraft: Battle for Azeroth.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\n  \u003c/article\u003e\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"onebox-metadata\"\u003e\n    \n    \n  \u003c/div\u003e\n\n  \u003cdiv style=\"clear: both\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/aside\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eIf a strat failed for you, and you want help\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSpecify EXACTLY which species and breeds you used.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSpecify whether you read a strategy and executed it manually, or downloaded and used tdScript.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSpecify EXACTLY where the first unexpected thing happened, the first thing that deviated from what the strat predicts. What died too early? What didn’t die when it was supposed to? What attack missed?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf possible, provide a log. You can see your log in the Pet Battle tab of your chat box. You can pull that out, make it bigger, screenshot it. Better still, you can use the addon Battle Pet Log Keeper from Curseforge, and do /pblk and Save Battle when the battle you want to log is complete.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese tips do help.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhen something goes wrong, don’t assume that the problem is in the strat you copied, or that the game is bugged. Figure out what’s happening.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn Liz’s case, her Torment ability, which she uses on rounds 1 and 7, hits each of your pets for 20% HP, \u003cem\u003eand she heals for that amount.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cblockquote\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTorment\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n5 Round Cooldown\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e100% Hit Chance\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDamage all enemy targets for 20% of their current health, and heal for 100% of that amount.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSo that ability really whacks your whole team, and heals her up.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI appreciate that you are still learning, but examining what actually happened is a better way to learn than posting rants! \u003cimg src=\"https://d1bg94bbsh66ji.cloudfront.net/en/wow/images/emoji/twitter/stuck_out_tongue.png?v=15\" title=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHere is a log I saved from my initial testing of Stratholme, which might illustrate:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRound 1\", – [1]\u003cbr\u003e\nHaunt applied Haunt to enemy Liz the Tormentor.“, – [2]\u003cbr\u003e\nHaunt dealt 1339 damage to your Wicked Soul.”, – [3]\u003cbr\u003e\nYour Wicked Soul died.“, – [4]\u003cbr\u003e\nTorment dealt 309 damage to your Blighted Squirrel.”, – [5]\u003cbr\u003e\nTorment healed 0 damage from enemy Liz the Tormentor.“, – [6]\u003cbr\u003e\nTorment dealt 214 damage to your Dream Whelpling.”, – [7]\u003cbr\u003e\nTorment healed 0 damage from enemy Liz the Tormentor.“, – [8]\u003cbr\u003e\nHaunt dealt 70 damage to enemy Liz the Tormentor.”, – [9]\u003cbr\u003e\nRound 1\", – [10]\u003cbr\u003e\nBlighted Squirrel is now your active pet.“, – [11]\u003cbr\u003e\nRound 2”, – [12]\u003cbr\u003e\nTremble in Fear dealt 305 damage to your Blighted Squirrel.“, – [13]\u003cbr\u003e\nTremble in Fear dealt 85 damage to your Dream Whelpling.”, – [14]\u003cbr\u003e\nTremble in Fear applied Speed Reduction to your Blighted Squirrel.“, – [15]\u003cbr\u003e\nTremble in Fear applied Attack Reduction to your Blighted Squirrel.”, – [16]\u003cbr\u003e\nWoodchipper dealt 69 damage to enemy Liz the Tormentor.“, – [17]\u003cbr\u003e\nWoodchipper applied Bleeding to enemy Liz the Tormentor.”, – [18]\u003cbr\u003e\nHaunt dealt 70 damage to enemy Liz the Tormentor.“, – [19]\u003cbr\u003e\nBleeding dealt 28 damage to enemy Liz the Tormentor.”, – [20]\u003cbr\u003e\nRound 3\", – [21]\u003cbr\u003e\nShadow Shock dealt 223 damage to your Blighted Squirrel.“, – [22]\u003cbr\u003e\nStampede dealt 17 damage to enemy Liz the Tormentor.”, – [23]\u003cbr\u003e\nStampede dealt 25 damage to enemy Liz the Tormentor (Critical).“, – [24]\u003cbr\u003e\nStampede dealt 17 damage to enemy Liz the Tormentor.”, – [25]\u003cbr\u003e\nStampede applied Shattered Defenses to enemy Liz the Tormentor.“, – [26]\u003cbr\u003e\nHaunt dealt 210 damage to enemy Liz the Tormentor.”, – [27]\u003cbr\u003e\nBleeding dealt 86 damage to enemy Liz the Tormentor.“, – [28]\u003cbr\u003e\nRound 4”, – [29]\u003cbr\u003e\nShadow Shock dealt 347 damage to your Blighted Squirrel.“, – [30]\u003cbr\u003e\nStampede dealt 52 damage to enemy Liz the Tormentor.”, – [31]\u003cbr\u003e\nStampede dealt 52 damage to enemy Liz the 